/T (The magnitudes seen in the ECG signals are given in mV, in which vary from either very large positive or negative numbers. This condition might affect the convergence of parameters and training times of the classifiers. For that reason, a minimum and maximum scaler was selected, given that, it maintains the morphology of the signal without modifying the patterns of the arrhythmias.)
